{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37816","headline":"南宫寓直 · 郑谷","name":"南宫寓直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寓直事非轻，宦孤忧且荣。\n制承黄纸重，词见紫垣清。\n晓霁庭松色，风和禁漏声。\n僧携新茗伴，吏扫落花迎。\n锁印诗心动，垂帘睡思生。\n粉廊曾试处，石柱昔贤名。\n来误宫窗燕，啼疑苑树莺。\n残阳应更好，归促恨严城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}